+        // Ravenry (apps/macos/patches/ghostty-hold-prompt-redraw.patch):
+        // a resize that changes the grid while the cursor is at a shell
+        // prompt clears the prompt (Screen.clearPromptForRedraw) for the
+        // shell to redraw. Ravenry's shell runs behind a daemon, so its
+        // redraw lands milliseconds later, not microseconds, and a frame
